12-Tool Registry -> Episode Runner
Tool-call Parser -> Episode Runner
Claude-generated Tasks -> BFS Solver
BFS Solver -> toolsmith-tasks
toolsmith-tasks -> SFT Warm-Start
SFT Warm-Start -> Decision-Point
Decision-Point -> Step-Level GRPO
Composite Reward -> Step-Level GRPO
Episode Runner -> Composite Reward
Step-Level GRPO -> Eval Runner
Eval Runner -> BFCL AST subsets
Eval Runner -> LLM Judge
Eval Runner -> Bootstrap CIs + Plots
Step-Level GRPO -> GGUF Export
GGUF Export -> FastMCP Server
GGUF Export -> Gradio Space

Sandbox Environment (Phase 1) { 12-Tool Registry, Tool-call Parser, Episode Runner }
Task Data (Phase 2) { Claude-generated Tasks, BFS Solver, toolsmith-tasks }
Training (Phases 3-4) { SFT Warm-Start, Decision-Point, Step-Level GRPO, Composite Reward }
Evaluation (Phase 5) { Eval Runner, BFCL AST subsets, LLM Judge, Bootstrap CIs + Plots }
Serving + Demo (Phase 7) { GGUF Export, FastMCP Server, Gradio Space }
